            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Inventory for 1 MJ heat from pellets, burned in a cogeneration unit with a capacity of 300 kWth. The multioutput process "pellets, burned in cogen 300kWth delivers the coproducts "heat, at cogen 300kWth, pellets, allocation exergy" and "electricity, at cogen 300kWth, pellets, allocation exergy". The energy efficiency is 30% for electricity and 54% for heat. The exergy factor is 1 for ectricity and 0.164 for heat. This leads to the allocation factor of 0.77 for electricity an 0.23 for heat.</common:generalComment>
